& [Scope]
  + exactly5 owned publication-bookend paths and 37 file or named semantic history events
  + actual implementation push equality and post-push replay are recorded without rewriting the frozen implementation snapshot
  + reentry file identity is preserved and only a new publication clause is added; all other bookend files are new
  + implementation source build outputs foreign work and protected Minecraft narrative are excluded

